  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-10-26** (recommended): audience recording; 6 songs; 40 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper recorded from Section 312, Row 15, Seat 17 in the stadium [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-10-26**: taped by Ultramega; transferred by Ultramega; source: [AUD] CA11 Cardioids->Tascam DR-07x 24bit/48k [1]. Also: Recorded with CA11 cardioid microphones into a Tascam DR-07x at 24-bit/48k WAV; Post-processing in Audacity: balance, adjustments, fades, track splitting, and FLAC conversion [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings B of A Stadium Charlotte Concert For Carolina Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/b-of-a-stadium-charlotte-concert-for-carolina-poster-regular/) [3]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings B of A Stadium Charlotte Concert For Carolina Sponsors Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/b-of-a-stadium-charlotte-concert-for-carolina-sponsors-poster-regular/) [4]",
